msgstr ""
"Pumili ng mga post kung saan dapat hindi paganahin ang gallery. Ipinapakita "
"ang hanggang 100 pinakabagong mga post. Mag-type upang maghanap."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3545 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3546
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3545
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3546
